Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Do you want to spend six\Nweeks in a sling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.76,0:00:04.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,or would you rather start\Nmoving tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,And we sort of said, let's\Npush the envelope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,because my mom has had two\Nreverses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:10.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,You know, just because\Nyou're 76,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:13.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,not driving for six weeks\Ncan really disable you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:16.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,from your life, your\Nlifestyle, your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,She drives my kids to\Nschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,And so really, we said, what\Nif we get people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:23.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,moving earlier, our\Ntechniques have gotten
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:26.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,we can push the envelope and\Nget people back faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:28.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,And so we did a head-to-head\Nstudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:29.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,We actually did one of my\Npartners
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,who did six weeks of\Nslinging,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:32.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I did people in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:35.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,For a few days afterwards,\Nyou start moving it right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:35.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:38.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,And we found that the\Noutcomes were similar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:41.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,no complications, no loss to\Na patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:44.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,And in fact, at six weeks,\Nthey're doing a ton better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:46.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,So sometimes, evidence shows\Nit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:48.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,and you have to change what\Nyou do.
